It could not be renamed
MSG_ICON_NOT_WRITTEN (//)
An icon could not be written
MSG_DISK_NOT_THERE (//)
The disk is not there
MSG_DISK_BUSY (//)
The disk is in use
MSG_DISK_NOT_FORMATTED (//)
The disk could not be formatted
