A file could not be moved there
MSG_LEFT_OUT_NOT_KEPT (//)
The disk will not keep what is left out
MSG_NO_MEMORY_WORK (//)
No memory to start the work
;
; The questions asked, with their buttons.
MSG_QUIT_RUNNING_ADDED (//)
Programs started from the desktop still run (%lu).\n\
They go on running. Windows, icons and\n\
menu items programs added to it (%lu)\n\
go with it.\n\nQuit the desktop?
MSG_QUIT_RUNNING (//)
Programs started from the desktop still run (%lu).\n\
They go on running.\n\nQuit the desktop?
MSG_QUIT_ADDED (//)
Windows, icons and menu items programs\n\
added to the desktop (%lu) go with it.\n\nQuit the desktop?
MSG_QUIT_ASK (//)
Quit the desktop?
MSG_QUIT_BUTTONS (//)
Quit|Cancel
MSG_DELETE_ASK (//)
Delete what is picked (%lu) for good?\n\
A drawer goes with all that is in it.
MSG_DELETE_BUTTONS (//)
Delete|Cancel
MSG_RENAME_PROMPT (//)
A new name for it:
MSG_FORMAT_TITLE (//)
Format Disk
MSG_FORMAT_ASK (//)
Format %s?\nEverything on it is lost.
MSG_FORMAT_BUTTONS (//)
Format|Cancel
MSG_NEW_DRAWER_PROMPT (//)
